236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (     We have made significant investments this season to enhance both our technical readiness and the local robotics ecosystem. In addition to procuring essential game elements and the high-volume fuel required for competition, we have actively contributed to the development of a community practice facility at the North End. By donating critical materials and collaborating with Royal Robotics and Chill Out, we helped establish a regulation-grade field that allows local teams to prototype designs and participate in scrimmages. This initiative ensures that we, along with our neighboring teams, have the dedicated space and resources necessary to refine our performance before heading to the official competition.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
